<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Cable &amp; Wireless joint venture.</title>
<headline>EU clears Cable &amp; Wireless joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared plans by Cable &amp; Wireless and A.P. Moeller's Maersk Data A/S to create a joint venture called Cable &amp; Wireless Nautec Ltd to provide communications for container ships, a European Union source said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal was notified to the EU executive on June 3.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
